<del></del></span> What is the BiS Discipline Priest gear?</h3>With many different sources of gearing in Mists of Pandaria Classic, targeting your absolute Best in Slot gear isn't entirely realistic; instead, we've created a Best in Slot list of ideal Discipline Priest drops found in Phase 3 from raids, dungeons, Reputation, and World Bosses to help you decide what to prioritize.<div class="pad exclude-units"></div>Most of your best pieces this tier will drop in the new Throne of Thunder raid, but while gearing up you'll often add gear from other sources, so you should reference the <a data-contiguous="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/guide/classes/priest/discipline/healer-stat-priority-pve">Stat Priorities for Discipline Priests</a> to help determine your own BiS gear based on what is available to you.<ul class="exclude-units"></ul>
