<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=94524/unerring-vision-of-lei-shen">
<img alt="Unerring Vision of Lei Shen" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_hunter_focusedaim.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Unerring Vision of Lei Shen</span></a> - Rare procs aren't ideal as healers but this gives you an <b>incredible</b> amount of stats while active. Requires you to spend a lot of the fight DPSing which we'll be doing anyway.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=94520/inscribed-bag-of-hydra-spawn">
