<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="crafting-professions">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c5" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_mace_39.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best Professions &amp; Crafted Gear for Discipline Priests</span></h2>The gap between professions is smaller this expansion than in the past so you have more flexibility.<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="engineering">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c5" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/ui_profession_engineering.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Engineering for Discipline Priests</h4>Engineering is a multi-faceted profession that offers a range of benefits, including:<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=126731/synapse-springs">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Synapse Springs</span></a>: An enchant you attach to your gloves that gives you an on-use Intellect increase. Can be combined with <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=109964/spirit-shell">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_shaman_astralshift.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Spirit Shell</span></a>.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=77533/lightweight-retinal-armor">
<img alt="Lightweight Retinal Armor" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_goggles_pandariatradeskill_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lightweight Retinal Armor</span></a>: A pre-raid helm that you can socket with two secondaries of your choice - Generally Crit and Spirit.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=55016/nitro-boosts">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nitro Boosts</span></a>: A sprint that's so ubiquitous across Classic that it's sometimes baked into raid strategies.</div></li></ul>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="blacksmithing">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c5" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/ui_profession_blacksmithing.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Blacksmithing for Discipline Priests</h4>Blacksmithing gives you two extra sockets: <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=55628/socket-bracer">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/item_socketedbracer.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Socket Bracer</span></a> and <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=55641/socket-gloves">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_addsocketglove.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Socket Gloves</span></a> - a flexible bonus since you can socket either pure Intellect, or Intellect + a secondary. The power also isn't conditional on anything else so it's active at all times.<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="alchemy">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c5" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/ui_profession_alchemy.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Alchemy for Discipline Priests</h4>Alchemy offers two bonuses: a strong pre-raid trinket (<a class="q3 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=75274/zen-alchemist-stone">
<img alt="Zen Alchemist Stone" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pet_scorchedstone.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Zen Alchemist Stone</span></a>) and 320 Intellect whenever we drink a flask. Alchemists also get <a class="q3 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=75525/alchemists-flask">
<img alt="Alchemist's Flask" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_endlesspotion.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Alchemist's Flask</span></a> which gives you the Intellect bonus even if you aren't using a big flask - useful for when you're questing or doing casual dungeon content.<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="leatherworking">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c11" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/ui_profession_leatherworking.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Leatherworking for Discipline Priests</h4>Leatherworking gives you an early intellect enchant: <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=124552/fur-lining-intellect">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_pelt_11.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fur Lining - Intellect</span></a>. You also gain <a class="q2 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=29530/drums-of-speed">
<img alt="Drums of Speed" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_drum_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Drums of Speed</span></a> which gives your group an AoE speed boost.<div class="pad exclude-units"></div>
<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="crafted-gear">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c5" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_mace_39.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best Crafted Gear for Discipline Priests</span></h3>Most crafted items don't require you to have the profession anymore. We can wear Tailoring items, for example, even if we aren't Tailors. Note that there are some exceptions to this which we'll note below.<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="phase-3-crafted-items-expensive-high-level">Phase 3 Crafted Items (Expensive, high level)</h4>
<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=94280/falling-blossom-hood">
<img alt="Falling Blossom Hood" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_cloth_raidpriest_m_01helm.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Falling Blossom Hood</span></a> (requires materials from Throne of Thunder)</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=94279/falling-blossom-sandals">
<img alt="Falling Blossom Sandals" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_cloth_raidpriest_m_01boot.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Falling Blossom Sandals</span></a> (requires materials from Throne of Thunder)</div></li></ul>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="phase-1-2-crafted-items-cheaper-lower-level">Phase 1/<wbr/>2 Crafted Items (Cheaper, lower level)</h4>
<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=82439/robes-of-creation">
<img alt="Robes of Creation" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_panda_b_01_red.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Robes of Creation</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=82440/gloves-of-creation">
<img alt="Gloves of Creation" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_cloth_reputation_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gloves of Creation</span></a></div></li>
